ions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2019-04-28T03:22:57Z","label":{"name":"needs triage","color":"5ce8b7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/487338726","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/5810#issuecomment-487338726","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/5810","id":487338726,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4NzMzODcyNg==","user":{"login":"zhan2046","id":18495305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDk1MzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18495305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046","html_url":"https://github.com/zhan2046","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-04-28T03:28:03Z","updated_at":"2019-04-28T03:32:56Z","body":"I have found a solution right now\r\n\r\n```java\r\n\r\npublic class MediaMetadataProvider implements MediaSessionConnector.MediaMetadataProvider {\r\n\r\n    private MediaSessionConnector.DefaultMediaMetadataProvider defaultMediaMetadataProvider;\r\n\r\n    public MediaMetadataProvider(\r\n            MediaControllerCompat mediaController, @Nullable String metadataExtrasPrefix) {\r\n        defaultMediaMetadataProvider =\r\n                new MediaSessionConnector.DefaultMediaMetadataProvider(mediaController, metadataExtrasPrefix);\r\n    }\r\n\r\n    @Override\r\n    public MediaMetadataCompat getMetadata(Player player) {\r\n        MediaMetadataCompat mediaMetadata = defaultMediaMetadataProvider.getMetadata(player);\r\n        if (mediaMetadata == null) {\r\n            mediaMetadata = new MediaMetadataCompat.Builder().build();\r\n        }\r\n        return mediaMetadata;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\n\r\n\r\nval mediaSessionConnector = MediaSessionConnector(mediaSession, null,\r\n                MediaMetadataProvider(mediaSession.controller, null))\r\n\r\nmediaSessionConnector.setPlayer(exoPlayer, mediaPlaybackPreparer)\r\n```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/487338726/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zhan2046","id":18495305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NDk1MzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18495305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046","html_url":"https://github.com/zhan2046","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhan2046/repos","events_url":"https